# A family's tags in a child module of its family's: refused (collision). Every tag of a
# family is declared in its family's module (Type System ch. 2), and a child module is a
# module of its own (claude/modules-style-pass.md, Jimmy's ruling of 5 November): a family's
# cases are all in one file.
# Written by Claude on the claude-self-hosting branch; subject to change.
emit Ui.*
mod Lines
use Ui

type Ink = row
derive ^Eq, ^Show

tag Ink.Fill of Ink:
    width: Nat
